  "description": "*EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY*\n\nChurches Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market No. 63 Castledawson, Sion Hill, a fantastic ground floor, one-bedroom apartment in one of Dublin's most sought-after areas. \n\nPresented in great condition, 63 Castledawson provides an opportunity to live in a highly accessible area of South Dublin, with plenty of transport links within walking distance. Five minutes walk away from Blackrock Village, this apartment is positioned nicely to take advantage of the numerous public amenities nearby, like Blackrock Park, Blackrock Shopping Centre and the Frascati Shopping Centre. Medical facilities like the Blackrock Clinic and St. Vincent's Private Hospital are also within walking distance.\n\n63 Castledawson briefly comprises of a large sitting room with glass door that opens onto the front patio which receives plenty of natural light, an archway that leads to the kitchen with ample storage space, a fantastic bathroom which has been recently renovated to a high standard, and a large double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\n\nThe living room and bedroom both feature wooden flooring, with the kitchen and bathroom featuring tiled flooring.\n\nAccommodation\nLiving Room - 3.3m x 5.6m\nKitchen - 2.65m x 1.93m\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.6m\nBedroom - 2.62m x 3.98m \n\nViewing is highly recommended.",
